es/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png/25px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png/38px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png/50px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Steel Watchers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png/25px-Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Portrait_Steel_Watcher.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher\" title=\"Steel Watcher\">Steel Watchers</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Known Watchers to carry Enriched Infernal Iron include, but may not be limited to:\n<ul><li>One standing by the <a href=\"/wiki/South_Span_Checkpoint\" title=\"South Span Checkpoint\">South Span Checkpoint</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Wyrm%27s_Crossing\" title=\"Wyrm's Crossing\">Wyrm's Crossing</a></li>\n<li>One standing outside the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a></li>\n<li>One standing in the <a href=\"/wiki/Heapside_Prison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heapside Prison\">Heapside Prison</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Aside from its monetary value and as a set item for the game's plot, Enriched Infernal Iron appears to have no other use.</li>\n<li>See also:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Alloy\" title=\"Infernal Alloy\">Infernal Alloy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Iron\" title=\"Infernal Iron\">Infernal Iron</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infernal_Metal\" title=\"Infernal 